  "comments": "Made-to-order coins exist:<br />\r\n- MTO 2542 sets of copper-silver-gold, from 1 Satang to 5 Baht. 16~18 sets believed to be made. (set of copper-silver-gold 1 Satang to 5 Baht series)<br />\r\n- Coins dated 2540 struck on aluminium planchet; PCGS <a href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80717147\" rel=\"nofollow\">#80717147</a>, PCGS <a href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80763606\" rel=\"nofollow\">#80763606</a>, ; PCGS <a href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/37982046\" rel=\"nofollow\">#37982046</a>. (set of aluminium 25-50 Satang 2540)<br />\r\n- Coin dated 2547 struck on Aluminium planchet. Non-graded. (could be error)<br />\r\n- Coin dated 2550 struck on Aluminium planchet. Non-graded. (could be error)<br />\r\n- Coin struck as double obverse; PCGS <a href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80717151\" rel=\"nofollow\">#80717151</a>. (set of double obverse and double reverse 25-50 Satang 2532)<br />\r\n- Coin struck as double reverse, dated 2532; PCGS <a href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80717152\" rel=\"nofollow\">#80717152</a>. (set of double obverse and double reverse 25-50 Satang 2532)<br />\r\n- Coin dated 2532 struck as medal alignment. PCGS <a href=\"https://www.pcgs.com/cert/80717158\" rel=\"nofollow\">#80717158</a>. (set of medal alignment 25 Satang to 5 Baht 2532)<br />\r\n- Coin dated 2542 struck as medal alignment. NGC <a href=\"https://www.ngccoin.com/certlookup/4536282-093/67\" rel=\"nofollow\">#4536282-093</a>, NGC <a href=\"https://www.ngccoin.com/certlookup/4536282-098/64\" rel=\"nofollow\">#4536282-098</a>. (could be error)<br />\r\n- Coin with <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/6644\">&quot;50th Anniversary of Reign (Y# 329)&quot;</a> mule reverse, struck as medal alignment. Non-graded.",
